docs/release/store-page.md:10:| 類型標籤（最多 20，前 5 最重要） | Auto Battler、Strategy、Cute、Local Multiplayer、Tactical、Casual、Pixel Graphics（地圖）、Turn-Based Strategy、Puzzle、Singleplayer、2D、Colorful、Short、Replay Value、Wargame、Medieval、Family Friendly、Strategy RPG（不選）…… |
docs/release/store-page.md:17:**繁中**：花 100 金擺好你的可愛小軍隊，按下開戰就不能再動——只能看著它們打到最後一秒。二十種兵互相剋制、輪流落子心理戰、最後時刻慢動作翻盤。
docs/release/store-page.md:18:**English**: Spend 100 gold, place your tiny army, press Battle — and no take-backs. Twenty units from swordsmen to exploding sheep, a turn-by-turn placement mind game, and slow-motion final seconds where the fight is won or lost.
docs/release/store-page.md:23:《落子無悔》是一款可愛的派兵自動對決小品。你只有 100 金和 24 個名額：劍士、盾兵、弓箭手、騎兵、刺客，每一種都剋兩種、怕兩種。擺好陣型按下開戰，接下來的 90 秒你只能看——看你的騎兵繞過盾牆衝散弓手，看對方的刺客潛行到你背後，看最後兩隻殘血小兵在慢動作裡決定勝負。
docs/release/store-page.md:29:- **傭兵公會開張，連魔物都來應徵**：除了王國軍 10 種，還有會自爆的爆爆羊、裝成寶箱咬人的寶箱怪、死了會分裂的史萊姆、能把敵人吸成一團的吸塵貓。每局自選 10 種上場。
docs/release/store-page.md:36:No Take-Backs is a cute little auto-battler about one decision: where your army stands. You get 100 gold and 24 slots. Swordsmen, shieldbearers, archers, cavalry and assassins — each counters two and fears two. Place them, press Battle, and for the next 90 seconds all you can do is watch.
docs/release/store-page.md:42:- **The guild is hiring, even monsters**: beyond the 10 Kingdom units, recruit exploding Boom Sheep, biting Mimics, splitting Slimes and a Vacuum Cat that sucks enemies into a clump. Pick any 10 types per battle.
